Third-party notices
-------------------

The published `uptide` command-line package bundles its dependencies into
packages/cli/dist. The notices for exactly those bundled packages -- name,
version, SPDX license identifier, and the full license and NOTICE text of each
-- are generated at build time into:

    packages/cli/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES

That file is a build artifact: it is produced by
`packages/cli/scripts/third-party-notices.mjs` from the bundler's own record of
what went into dist, and it ships inside the npm tarball as
`THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES`. Run `pnpm build` to generate it locally.
